WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
Welcome to the Alister Bank web account guide. Follow the application, email verification,

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
video KYC, sandbox activation, account setup, and first sign-in. These are illustrative screens

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
with example data, not a live account recording.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Keep your email inbox, mobile number, identity documents, and signature ready. You will

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
also need a camera for video KYC. This project's India services are limited

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
to pre-approved participants. On the homepage, select Request Account Access to open the

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
application.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Select your country. Enter your first and last name, email, mobile number, date

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.000
of birth, and gender as required by the form. Choose Savings, Current, or

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Business Elite. Complete any other relevant fields, then select Next Step. Your country

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
determines the document requirements.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.500
If you selected Business Elite, complete the additional Company Info step. Provide your

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.000
company name, entity type, registration details, and the business documents marked as required.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.500
The account will be held in the company name. Savings and Current applicants

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.000
skip this step.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.333
Enter your residential address, city, state or province, and PIN or postal code.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:50.667
Address line two is optional. Indian PIN codes must contain six digits. Check

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:54.000
that your address is accurate, then continue to Documents.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.200
Document requirements depend on your country. For India, provide PAN and Aadhaar numbers

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.400
and uploads, a live selfie, and your signature. Passport and address proof are

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.600
optional for India. Nepal, Bhutan, and Bangladesh have different identity-document requirements and require

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.800
address proof. Successful PAN verification can update and lock your legal name. Upload

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:10.000
clear supported images or PDFs.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Check the displayed email address, then select Send OTP. Open your inbox and

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.000
enter the six-digit code you received. Verify the code before moving forward. If

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.000
the email address is wrong, use Change and request a new code. Never

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.000
share your OTP with anyone.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Review your personal details, company details if applicable, address, and KYC documents. Read

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.000
the terms and privacy information. Go back to correct any mistakes, then submit

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.000
the application. Keep the customer ID shown in the confirmation. Your account still

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.000
needs the remaining verification and activation steps.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.500
After submission, look for the video KYC invitation sent to your registered email

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.000
address. Delivery and review can take time, so check your spam folder too.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.500
Open the secure link in a supported browser, read the consent screen, and

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.000
allow camera access. Contact support if your link has expired.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:47.500
Position your face inside the circle in good lighting. Follow the on-screen movement

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:51.000
prompts, which can vary between sessions, and blink when asked. Keep still while

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.500
the selfie is captured automatically. Review the captured selfie and retake it if

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.000
the image is not clear.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.000
Capture your identity document using the on-screen guide. Keep every edge visible and

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.000
avoid glare. Review the extracted name, date of birth, and ID number, correcting

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.000
any reading errors. Submit the verification. A successful capture is not a guarantee

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.000
of approval; wait for the next email.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.500
After KYC processing, open the activation-deposit link in your email. Check the account

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.000
and minimum amount shown. This project's deposit is a sandbox simulation, not a

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.500
real payment. Use only an admin-approved sandbox test card, never a real payment

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.000
card. After confirmation, wait for the separate account-setup email.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.500
Open the account-setup link from your email. Choose a username with at least

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.000
five characters. Create a unique password with at least eight characters and confirm

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.500
it. Set a four-digit security PIN used to authorize transfers. Select Activate My

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.000
Account, then Login Now. Keep your password and PIN private.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.400
On the login page, choose the Password tab. Enter your username or registered

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.800
email and your new password. Type the characters shown in your own CAPTCHA;

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.200
refresh it if it is hard to read. Select Sign In. If your

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.600
credentials are accepted, you will reach the dashboard. Use Forgot password if you

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.000
need to reset your password.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.000
After a successful login, review your account details and explore the dashboard's account

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:54.000
tools. Keep your OTP, password, and security PIN private, and sign out on

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.000
shared devices. You can replay any chapter in this guide whenever you need

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.000
a reminder.
